thread 'main' panicked at examples/isogeny_fiber_primitive_price.rs:1273:24:
called `Option::unwrap()` on a `None` value

The first native reducer assumed every target row had query_group_ops.
The rho rows instead use rho_group_ops. This reducer error did not affect
the 60-child run or its independent replay; the corrected reducer is V2.
